WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.224
An RSVP night

2
00:00:02.506 --> 00:00:05.176
no tickets, just a list.

3
00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:08.123
Switch to Lantern Room,

4
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:10.418
then plus, Create event,

5
00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:12.262
RSVP event.

6
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.554
Name it.

7
00:00:17.788 --> 00:00:20.376
The format stays In person.

8
00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:24.196
Vibes and genres become tags,

9
00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:26.234
then a line about the night

10
00:00:26.516 --> 00:00:28.933
this one is free and open to the block.

11
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.262
Step two:

12
00:00:34.622 --> 00:00:35.774
one date,

13
00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.257
doors at seven,

14
00:00:37.459 --> 00:00:38.737
ends at ten,

15
00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:40.050
New York time.

16
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.885
Step three:

17
00:00:44.042 --> 00:00:46.372
the venue and its address.

18
00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:49.179
Leave Hide address off,

19
00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:50.583
so neighbours can find you.

20
00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.506
Step four,

21
00:00:56.606 --> 00:00:57.538
the cover

22
00:00:57.982 --> 00:01:00.671
a video, then the photos guests

23
00:01:00.671 --> 00:01:01.933
swipe through underneath.

24
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.212
Step five is the one

25
00:01:07.212 --> 00:01:10.205
that only exists on an RSVP.

26
00:01:10.909 --> 00:01:12.491
Limit the guest list,

27
00:01:12.491 --> 00:01:14.949
and set the number the room holds.

28
00:01:15.723 --> 00:01:17.854
Let guests bring extras

29
00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:20.707
each extra counts toward your limit.

30
00:01:21.435 --> 00:01:24.175
Start a waitlist for when it fills.

31
00:01:25.052 --> 00:01:27.283
Approve people automatically,

32
00:01:27.335 --> 00:01:28.807
or one at a time.

33
00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.014
And a chip-in:

34
00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:32.842
suggest an amount,

35
00:01:32.896 --> 00:01:34.251
set a minimum,

36
00:01:34.332 --> 00:01:36.608
and guests pay what they like.

37
00:01:37.386 --> 00:01:40.172
It stays optional, and payouts are

38
00:01:40.172 --> 00:01:42.037
on from the moment you publish.

39
00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:49.577
Keep the guest list private if you want,

40
00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:52.040
or hide how many spots are left.

41
00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:55.297
Public, and on the discovery feed,

42
00:01:55.297 --> 00:01:57.914
means anyone on Mingla can find it.

43
00:01:58.832 --> 00:02:01.052
Publish, and the invite link

44
00:02:01.052 --> 00:02:02.722
goes live immediately

45
00:02:03.071 --> 00:02:05.299
the page shows who's going,

46
00:02:05.373 --> 00:02:07.012
and how many spots remain.
